; Rotation order: Flatlands, Pillars, Ferry, Highrise, Erosion, Islands,
; Furnace, Gauntlet, Cascade, Slant, Bowl. The four stages built on the #18
; parts are interleaved rather than appended, so a stage whose floor moves or
; falls out never immediately follows another one -- a run of them back to
; back would read as the whole game having changed rather than as one stage
; having a gimmick. tools/scenario_runner.gd's STAGE_PATHS lists the same
; eleven in this same order, and the two are meant to stay that way.
[node name="RoundManager" type="Node" parent="."]
script = ExtResource("4")
player_paths = [NodePath("../Player1"), NodePath("../Player2"), NodePath("../Player3"), NodePath("../Player4"), NodePath("../Player5"), NodePath("../Player6"), NodePath("../Player7"), NodePath("../Player8")]
